  <section class="container">
    <h1 style="border-bottom: 4px solid #ce9f1c; margin-bottom: 20px;"><a id="wb-cont"></a>Projects</h1>
    <p>

The following projects have been referred to <abbr title="Major Projects Office">MPO</abbr> and receive support such as concierge services, regulatory coordination, financial coordination and structuring, and potential listing under the <em>Building Canada Act</em>.


</p>
    <p><a href="/en/privy-council/major-projects-office/projects/map.html">See these projects on the interactive map</a></p>
    <p><a href="/en/privy-council/major-projects-office/supporting-proponents.html">Learn more about the work <abbr title="Major Projects Office">MPO</abbr> does in support of  these projects</a> </p>
  </section>
  <div>&nbsp;</div>
</div>


</div>
